capes.com/km0y1pe9t375yfveyt9","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/q9fjp69m6ubbmy640b27","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/uvxugjyulfnr8u1oesx","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Ocean Drive Ibiza","offer_country_name":"Spain","location_heading":"Ibiza","title":"Iconic Ibiza Art Deco Escape with Rooftop Bar","description":"$19","location_subheading":"Spain","price":130,"original_price":130,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000005GAjbAAG","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/urnbtccj8igwur2bld4","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/22hfrh89x5eo19cz20kqcf","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/54ocdjyymdm5cdzqgfhj","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Montesol Experimental Ibiza","offer_country_name":"Spain","location_heading":"Ibiza","title":"Ibiza Five-Star Beachside Retreat with Rooftop Bar in the Heart of Old Town","description":"Experience the vibrant spirit of the Balearic with a stay at Montesol Experimental Ibiza. This bohemian retreat is ideally located in the heart of Ibiza's Old Town, a UNESCO World Heritage site, with the historic Dalt Vila and bustling Marina Botafoch on its doorstep. Savour the flavours of the Mediterranean at the hotel's acclaimed Café Montesol, unwind with a cocktail at the stylish rooftop bar or explore the island's renowned nightlife scene.","location_subheading":"Spain","price":172,"original_price":172,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000FNDivAAH","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/nzvnzbd8uplu4tu7urfd5","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/he3g3trfya4lx2ihn6zj","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/rv5rrgcpa9hw4heaj3hw","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Six Senses Ibiza","offer_country_name":"Spain","location_heading":"Ibiza","title":"Blissful Ibiza Oceanfront Luxury with 1,200sqm Wellness Centre","description":"In a serene pocket along Ibiza's northern coast, discover a place where luxury and conscious travel meet - Six Senses Ibiza, perched overlooking the crystal-clear Xarraca Bay. Farm-to-table practices can be found at the Beach Caves, a venue built into the rock face overlooking the ocean, where exquisite meals, epic sunsets and live music await. For a treasured tipple, visit Ibiza 500, the onsite wine cellar where master sommeliers have handpicked the best drops from the verdant Ibiza soil for you to sample. When you've had your fill, hide away in wellness center - spanning 1,200 square metres - that features the RoseBar longevity lounge, steam room, hammam, a state-of-the-art fitness area and seafront yoga deck.","location_subheading":"Spain","price":650,"original_price":650,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000008h130AAA","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/yoly3ctf7l6u1jl6rdu","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/o1sasptg0nsujj8xl3jv","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/w7tbf8ygcf5cpaa0pr","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 1","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}]}]
